nts","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"American (Traditional)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Hotels & Travel","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","review_id":"JELnODMXpjJLqU_Cqe3wIA","date":"2018-08-22T03:25:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9439512491226196,"text_excerpt":"I love the jazz music! Away from the hustle and bustle of Bourbon street, and tucked inside Royal Sonesta, JazzPlayhouse is truly a hidden gem! The one drink minimum with no cover is a stellar deal! The jazz club is upscale and the musicians are much more talented than the local ones performing at the tourist bars on Bourbon street or even Frenchmen Street. It's a big difference! I went on Sat night and there was a quartet and an amazing female singer, Nayo Jones. She sang a wonderful rendition and tribute to Aretha Franklin with \"Feel like a Natural Woman\". All of the musicians were also really good especially the piano and saxophone players, who had solos. I really enjoyed the cocktails..."},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","review_id":"RxiU_x-TmkcuWjlBbwebAw","date":"2012-06-30T02:39:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9388741850852966,"text_excerpt":"Found this place on Yelp, just wish finding the actual club were as easy. After walking around the hotel for a bit trying to figure out where it was, we finally came across it. Friday night jazz band was great - LOVED the no cover charge. Just a one drink minimum per set. Stayed for the Burlesque show - starts at midnight on Fridays. First time seeing a show, and it was a lot of fun. Sassy, sexy, and amazing music - there was a great singer performing. This is the perfect place to get your fill of Jazz music (in the a/c - unlike Preservation Hall) - right on Bourbon Street, while still feeling like it's SO FAR from Bourbon Street. (in ambiance)"},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","review_id":"d7bbgtItZ7FXPZvMJqMhqw","date":"2020-02-03T18:30:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365423917770386,"text_excerpt":"We were staying in the Royal Sonesta on Bourbon Street and saw they had a jazz club with nightly entertainment. We thought that would be a fun thing to do and paid the $20 for a VIP ticket so we could get reserved seating. Well worth the price! The experience was so much better having a good seat waiting for you. It's free otherwise (with 2 drink minimum), but you could be standing if you don't plan ahead. We got to see Nayo Jones, and she was incredible! I don't know if she is a monthly regular or not, but her show is awesome! We did decide to eat dinner here. Food is limited - just some bites really - but it was all pretty good. The kitchen that provides the food is from the Desire Oyst..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","photo_id":"Ej5cA2hWBnK9x1k0A0RNTA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Ej5cA2hWBnK9x1k0A0RNTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8851391077041626},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","photo_id":"OypL6abeUQPjw6mSlcM73w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OypL6abeUQPjw6mSlcM73w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8686010837554932},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","photo_id":"vDW48L0K2HMRv9f0qNa3oA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vDW48L0K2HMRv9f0qNa3oA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283770084381104},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","photo_id":"LYrk-BJh2CcRM-TIl2xd6A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LYrk-BJh2CcRM-TIl2xd6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7894101738929749},{"business_id":"OjXIRs2Gm4H6hWo4bC7Qvg","photo_id":"dBIR8BpmYAqZcSUV7HcZRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dBIR8BpmYAqZcSUV7HcZRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7367987632751465}]},"notebook_case":null}
